OL,3,GNEWSANew statue unveiled as Glasgow
OL,4,Acelebrates links to Nelson Mandela
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new statue of Nelson Mandela has been
OL,7,Funveiled in Glasgow, celebrating the
OL,8,Fformer South African President's links
OL,9,Fto the city.
OL,11,FThe statue from sculptor Alan B Herriot
OL,12,Fwill stand in the city's Nelson Mandela
OL,13,FPlace, having been chosen from a
OL,14,Fshortlist last year.
OL,16,FGlasgow was the first city in the world
OL,17,Fto award its freedom to Mandela in
OL,18,F1981, at a time when he was still in
OL,19,Fprison in South Africa.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
