OL,3,GNEWSANew statue unveiled as Glasgow
OL,4,Acelebrates links to Nelson Mandela
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the country's
OL,7,Fanti-apartheid struggle later visited
OL,8,FGlasgow in 1993 - three years after he
OL,9,Fwas released from jail.
